Bookshelf: your library as a grid of covers
Tap a book to see it in the top panel
Recent: what you've been reading, in two columns
Tap a book there too
Series: each series together. Open one
Then tap a book inside it
The book button brings back what you're reading
Back to Home
Long-press the page counter for a list, then spines
Swipe up for a full screen shelf
Pinch for smaller books, more to a screen
Spread for bigger ones
